  <div class="gold-line"></div>

  <!-- ── SECTION 6: HOW-TO INSTRUCTIONS ── -->
  <div class="am-section">
    <div class="am-section-title">📖 How To Use This System</div>
    <div class="am-section-sub">Simple 3-step guide for keeping your portfolio up to date.</div>

    <div class="instructions-grid">
      <div class="inst-card">
        <div class="inst-num">01</div>
        <h4>Upload Your Files Here</h4>
        <p>Use the upload zones above to add your photo, CV, and project files. Files load instantly in your browser — no internet or server needed.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Profile photo: JPG or PNG, portrait preferred</li>
          <li>CV: PDF format for best results</li>
          <li>Projects: screenshots (JPG/PNG) or PDF reports</li>
          <li>Max file size: 10MB per file</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="inst-card">
        <div class="inst-num">02</div>
        <h4>Preview Everything Instantly</h4>
        <p>Every upload shows a live preview so you can verify how it looks before sharing. The visitor preview shows exactly what employers and clients will experience.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Photo preview shows portrait crop</li>
          <li>CV preview opens in browser tab</li>
          <li>Download button works for visitors</li>
          <li>All links are fully functional</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="inst-card">
        <div class="inst-num">03</div>
        <h4>Add New Projects Anytime</h4>
        <p>Click "+ Add New Project Slot" to add more portfolio items. To add a project permanently, open portfolio.html in a text editor and copy an existing portfolio card block.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Use the filter tabs to organize by category</li>
          <li>Update data-cat and data-title attributes</li>
          <li>Replace placeholder SVG icons with screenshots</li>
          <li>Both files work together — keep them in same folder</li>
